      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} x \\text{和} y \\text{的联合概率密度为}\\\\f(x,y) = \\begin{cases} 6x^2y, &amp; 0 &lt; x &lt; 1, \\, 0 &lt; y &lt; 1 \\\\ 0, &amp; \\text{其它} \\end{cases}. \\\\\\text{按题意需要要求的是} |X-Y| \\text{的数学期望，即有}\\\\E(|X-Y|) = \\int_{[0,1]} \\int_{[0,1]} |x-y| 6x^2y \\, dy \\\\= \\iint_{D_1} [-(x-y)6x^2y] \\, dx \\, dy + \\iint_{D_3} (x-y)6x^2y \\, dx \\, dy \\\\= \\frac{1}{12} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{4} (\\text{小时}) \\, (D_1, D_3 \\text{如图}) \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} x \\text{和} y \\text{的联合概率密度为}\\\\f(x,y) = \\begin{cases} 6x^2y, &amp; 0 &lt; x &lt; 1, \\, 0 &lt; y &lt; 1 \\\\ 0, &amp; \\text{其它} \\end{cases}. \\\\\\text{按题意需要要求的是} |X-Y| \\text{的数学期望，即有}\\\\E(|X-Y|) = \\int_{[0,1]} \\int_{[0,1]} |x-y| 6x^2y \\, dy \\\\= \\iint_{D_1} [-(x-y)6x^2y] \\, dx \\, dy + \\iint_{D_3} (x-y)6x^2y \\, dx \\, dy \\\\= \\frac{1}{12} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{4} (\\text{小时}) \\, (D_1, D_3 \\text{如图}) \\end{aligned}</div>"
